== About ==
Ford was an ordinary navy man.

Even an ordinary man has his own secrets. Thus, Ford was no exception.

A man's name is not important. What is important are his motives and actions.

Ford was a very tough man.

The only person who can shake his determination was probably his wife, Olivia..

